# LCX TERMINAL
# The updater signing PRIVATE key lives outside the repo (~/.lcx-terminal/) and
# must never be committed — it is the only thing standing between an operator's
# machine and a forged auto-update. Only the public key is in tauri.conf.json.
*.key
updater.key*
# Belt-and-braces: Rust build output (also ignored in apps/desktop/src-tauri).
apps/desktop/src-tauri/target/
apps/desktop/src-tauri/gen/schemas/
